  "description": "Dirty Little Duo – Procreate Inker & Fill Brushes\nTwo brushes. One gloriously dirty little duo. 😈\nDirty Little Duo is a set of 2 Procreate brushes designed to bring rough lines, gritty texture, and wonderfully imperfect fills to your artwork.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED\n🖊️ Dirty Little Inker\nA rough, textured inking brush for sketchy line art, doodles, cartoons, lettering, and illustration.\n🖌️ Pepperpot Fill\nA speckled, grainy fill brush for coloring, shading, backgrounds, and adding instant texture and grit.\nGREAT FOR\n– Rough and sketchy line art\n– Doodles and cartoons\n– Character illustration\n– Coloring and fills\n– Texture and shading\n– Grungy artwork\n– Hand-drawn effects\n– Quirky lettering\n– Background texture\n– Adding imperfect, organic texture\nUse them individually or together for artwork with a loose, handmade feel and plenty of personality.\nPLEASE NOTE\nThese brushes are made for Procreate and require Procreate to use.\nTwo brushes. Lots of texture. Absolutely no need to keep things clean. 😂",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Dirty Little Duo – Procreate Inker &amp; Fill Brushes<br>\nTwo brushes. One gloriously dirty little duo. 😈</p>\n<p>Dirty Little Duo is a set of 2 Procreate brushes designed to bring rough lines, gritty texture, and wonderfully imperfect fills to your artwork.</p>\n<p>WHAT’S INCLUDED<br>\n🖊️ Dirty Little Inker<br>\nA rough, textured inking brush for sketchy line art, doodles, cartoons, lettering, and illustration.<br>\n🖌️ Pepperpot Fill<br>\nA speckled, grainy fill brush for coloring, shading, backgrounds, and adding instant texture and grit.</p>\n<p>GREAT FOR<br>\n– Rough and sketchy line art<br>\n– Doodles and cartoons<br>\n– Character illustration<br>\n– Coloring and fills<br>\n– Texture and shading<br>\n– Grungy artwork<br>\n– Hand-drawn effects<br>\n– Quirky lettering<br>\n– Background texture<br>\n– Adding imperfect, organic texture</p>\n<p>Use them individually or together for artwork with a loose, handmade feel and plenty of personality.</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE<br>\nThese brushes are made for Procreate and require Procreate to use.<br>\nTwo brushes. Lots of texture. Absolutely no need to keep things clean. 😂</p>",
